      "message": "fix(motion): check trochoidal clean-up engagement with step-down and advisory warning\n\nMeasures 2D and 3D Adaptive (Trochoidal) clean-up passes against the\npost-lane stock across every max_engagement setting, steps down the\npeel step along CLEANUP_LADDER when needed, and surfaces an advisory\nWarning::EngagementExceeded if reduced steps still exceed the limit.\n\nFixes #3849",
