      "message": "test(motion): run the #3849 clean-up checks in the adaptive_troch_parallel binary\n\nThe six clean-up engagement tests move from the new top-level binary\ncrates/motion/tests/adaptive_troch_clean.rs into a module of the existing\nadaptive_troch_parallel binary (crates/motion/tests/adaptive_troch_parallel/clean.rs).\nThat binary already maps adaptive_troch_clean in its Gate map and shares the\nsame fixtures. No new test binary (New tests join a directory suite, #3187).\n\nRefs #3849\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
